{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方第一块超大号白色粗体文字，尤其是“回去未必找得回那份亲近”和“万一能呢”；随后容易被下方同样醒目的第二块大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"不确定（能隐约看出他在考虑回去能否找回曾经的亲近，但当下具体处境不够明确）。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"隐约有牵挂、期待和犹豫，但核心感受不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他决定先把眼下日子过稳，不愿因为害怕而收回已经做出的打算；虽然仍然害怕、缺乏底气，却正在向前走。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"上下两块大字字号和亮度接近，争夺主视线。\",\n    \"第一块长句需要读完整才能理解“明知未必找回亲近，却仍抱有希望”的心理关系。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在上下两块文字中，需要结合第二块才能知道他实际的选择以及害怕与行动之间的关系。\",\n    \"第二块单块较长，包含忍让、稳定生活、独自承担、害怕和不撤回打算等多层意思。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b66db363-4021-4b87-9589-cb93940b0f6b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T013731228395Z", "elapsed_seconds": 35.735, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:38:06.972239+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "53d8a2fdd38420836cd393d057582726e74b7cc4556b08fbe7f1f46dae2ce6bd", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1